### 1. Hae kaikki urheilijat
GET http://localhost:3001/api/athletes


### 2. Lisää uusi urheilija
POST http://localhost:3001/api/athletes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Aino",
  "last_name": "Virtanen",
  "nickname": "Aikku",
  "birth_date": "2000-05-12",
  "weight": 62.5,
  "image_url": "https://example.com/urheilija.jpg",
  "sport": "Yleisurheilu",
  "achievements": "Suomen mestaruus 2025"
}


### 3. Hae yksi urheilija
GET http://localhost:3001/api/athletes/1


### 4. Päivitä urheilija
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/athletes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Aino",
  "last_name": "Virtanen",
  "nickname": "Aikku",
  "birth_date": "2000-05-12",
  "weight": 63,
  "image_url": "https://example.com/urheilija.jpg",
  "sport": "Yleisurheilu",
  "achievements": "Suomen mestaruus 2025, uusi ennätys"
}


### 5. Poista urheilija
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/athletes/1